: "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18894, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NS46N3G5CdCexV2mvYiJaW", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18894, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01F5TKfLA3WbxhRZk9dLGLDj", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19194, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01F5TKfLA3WbxhRZk9dLGLDj", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19194, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01F5TKfLA3WbxhRZk9dLGLDj", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 23415, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01CtVUQW2GY1vsxkda8c1VkC", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (and its v2.3.1-rc) failed health checks in production, with an error rate of 0.18 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. The first rollback attempt partly failed: the orchestrator error stopped the rollout after us-east, leaving the service on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). The second rollback succeeded. All regions now run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is 0.002. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failures and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54015, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01CtVUQW2GY1vsxkda8c1VkC", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54015, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CtVUQW2GY1vsxkda8c1VkC", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55167, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01VCeLQSA7MEQJufKC2u8dcG", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55467, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01VCeLQSA7MEQJufKC2u8dcG", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55467, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01VCeLQSA7MEQJufKC2u8dcG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59946, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident, INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. Both v2.3.1 and the v2.3.1-rc before it failed health checks.\n- The first rollback stopped partway because of an error in the deployment system. Only us-east moved to v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1.\n- Rolling back to a fixed version is safe to repeat, so I tried again once and it went through. All three regions now run v2.3.0. The service is healthy, and the error rate fell from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n**Incident**\n- **What happened:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api, open) describes the failed release, the partial first rollback, the retry and the current healthy state. The request to create it timed out. I checked the incident list afterwards and only one incident exists, so there's no duplicate.\n- **Follow-up:** The incident lists two things to look into: why v2.3.1 failed, and the error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LrGedeA1qzTcgw7VXQCBrN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015iYTXhxzAwcJ9f1nUc2ba4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1; seq 2 and 3 are both unhealthy). Rolling back.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PujcQxgWesMouRZg2sxBXS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UhooqhUXf4WwtMdagJ9arD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only partly worked: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to a set target version is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01K1rSt9qxuHE1SsAdgbo8Xz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NS46N3G5CdCexV2mvYiJaW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01F5TKfLA3WbxhRZk9dLGLDj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CtVUQW2GY1vsxkda8c1VkC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (and its v2.3.1-rc) failed health checks in production, with an error rate of 0.18 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. The first rollback attempt partly failed: the orchestrator error stopped the rollout after us-east, leaving the service on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). The second rollback succeeded. All regions now run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is 0.002. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failures and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VCeLQSA7MEQJufKC2u8dcG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident, INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. Both v2.3.1 and the v2.3.1-rc before it failed health checks.\n- The first rollback stopped partway because of an error in the deployment system. Only us-east moved to v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1.\n- Rolling back to a fixed version is safe to repeat, so I tried again once and it went through. All three regions now run v2.3.0. The service is healthy, and the error rate fell from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n**Incident**\n- **What happened:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api, open) describes the failed release, the partial first rollback, the retry and the current healthy state. The request to create it timed out. I checked the incident list afterwards and only one incident exists, so there's no duplicate.\n- **Follow-up:** The incident lists two things to look into: why v2.3.1 failed, and the error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}